---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="About — Ashesi Research Club">
  <main>
    <div class="eyebrow">The club</div>
    <h1>Research, told as a magazine</h1>
    <p class="standfirst">
      The Ashesi Research Club exists to make student and faculty research impossible to ignore —
      one profile, one finding, one story at a time.
    </p>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        Great research happens at Ashesi every semester, and most of it is only ever read by a
        supervisor and a grading panel. The club was founded to change that: we find the work,
        interview the people behind it, and publish it the way a magazine would — with real
        headlines, real narrative, and respect for the reader's time.
      </p>
      <h2>What we do</h2>
      <p>
        The editorial desk commissions and writes researcher profiles, from signal-processing
        algorithms that work where GPS fails to vision-language models built for healthcare in
        Ghana. Every story is fact-checked with the researcher and edited for a general reader —
        no jargon walls, no abstracts pasted into paragraphs.
      </p>
      <h2>Why a magazine</h2>
      <p>
        Because stories travel further than papers. A well-told profile brings a researcher's work
        to classmates, future collaborators, and funders who would never open a journal PDF. The
        black-on-white pages you're reading are deliberate: fast, calm, and about the work.
      </p>
      <h2>Get involved</h2>
      <p>
        If you're researching something worth telling — or you want to write, edit, or design for
        the desk — <a href="/apply/">pitch it to the club</a>. We review applications on a rolling
        basis.
      </p>
    </div>
  </main>
</Base>

<style>
  main { max-width: var(--reading-max); margin: 0 auto; padding: 48px 24px 96px; }
  .eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: var(--track-label);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  h1 { font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 400; font-size: 48px; line-height: 1.05; color: var(--ink); margin: 12px 0 20px; }
  .standfirst {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 21px;
    line-height: var(--body-line-tight);
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin: 0 0 26px;
    padding-bottom: 26px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--hairline);
  }

  @media (max-width: 767px) {
    main { padding: 32px 20px 72px; }
    h1 { font-size: 36px; }
  }
</style>
